Feature: RT-L6 assert integration — a scenario-named assertion reports through the migrated Teko harness scenario state

  Scenario: scenario_pass_announces — a passing assertion inside a named scenario prints the case name on its ok line, exit 0
    Given env = ["TEKO_BACKEND=c"]
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "scenario integrated_case: ok"
    And exit = 0

  Scenario: scenario_fail_prefixes — a failing assertion inside a named scenario traps with the scenario name prefixing the message
    Given source = "cases/scenario_fail.tks"
    Given env = ["TEKO_BACKEND=c"]
    When built and run
    Then it traps
    And stderr pattern = "integrated_case: assertion failed: eq_i64 — expected 3, got 2"
